    "body": "> One approach is to say that a site's entire \"indexeddb manager\" or \"lock manager\" resides in a single value within the local session storage bottle map for \"indexeddb\" or \"lock\", but that also feels kinda weird.\r\n\r\nI think that would be okay though. But I suppose we could abstract it differently in that a bottle holds a value and the map is something we stick there for `sessionStorage` and `localStorage`...",
